  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": 302,
      "sort_order": 10,
      "published": true,
      "data": {
        "title": "Fonctionnement de l’alphabet phonétique de l’OTAN",
        "text": "<p><strong>L’alphabet phonétique de l’OTAN</strong> attribue à chaque lettre latine un mot codé : A est <em>Alfa</em>, B est <em>Bravo</em>, C est <em>Charlie</em>. Il sert à transmettre noms, indicatifs, numéros et codes à la radio ou au téléphone en cas de bruit.</p><p>Saisissez des lettres latines et des chiffres pour les encoder, ou passez au décodage. Choisissez NATO/ICAO, les nombres d’aviation, LAPD ou DIN&nbsp;5009, le séparateur, le format « A = Alfa » et l’écoute dans le navigateur.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "sort_order": 20,
      "published": true,
      "data": {
        "title": "Tableau de l’alphabet phonétique de l’OTAN",
        "text": "<div class=\"nato-ref\"><p class=\"nato-ref__intro\">Chaque lettre a un mot codé distinct ; le guide indique l’accentuation prescrite.</p><ul class=\"nato-ref__grid\"><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">A</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Alfa</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">AL-FAH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">B</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Bravo</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">BRAH-VOH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">C</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Charlie</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">CHAR-LEE</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">D</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Delta</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">DELL-TAH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">E</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Echo</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">ECK-OH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">F</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Foxtrot</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">FOKS-TROT</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">G</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Golf</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">GOLF</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">H</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Hotel</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">HOH-TELL</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">I</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">India</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">IN-DEE-AH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">J</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Juliett</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">JEW-LEE-ETT</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">K</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Kilo</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">KEY-LOH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">L</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Lima</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">LEE-MAH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">M</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Mike</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">MIKE</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">N</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">November</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">NO-VEM-BER</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">O</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Oscar</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">OSS-CAH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">P</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Papa</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">PAH-PAH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">Q</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Quebec</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">KEH-BECK</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">R</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Romeo</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">ROW-ME-OH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">S</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Sierra</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">SEE-AIR-RAH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">T</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Tango</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">TANG-GO</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">U</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Uniform</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">YOU-NEE-FORM</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">V</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Victor</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">VIK-TAH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">W</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Whiskey</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">WISS-KEY</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">X</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">X-ray</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">ECKS-RAY</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">Y</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Yankee</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">YANG-KEY</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">Z</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Zulu</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">ZOO-LOO</span></span></li></ul><h3 class=\"nato-ref__subtitle\">Chiffres</h3><ul class=\"nato-ref__grid nato-ref__grid--numbers\"><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">0</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Zero</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">ZEE-RO</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">1</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">One</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">WUN</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">2</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Two</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">TOO</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">3</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Three</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">TREE</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">4</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Four</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">FOWER</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">5</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Five</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">FIFE</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">6</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Six</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">SIX</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">7</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Seven</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">SEV-EN</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">8</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Eight</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">AIT</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">9</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Nine</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">NIN-ER</span></span></li></ul></div>"
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "id": 637,
      "sort_order": 10,
      "published": true,
      "data": {
        "question": "Alfa ou Alpha, Juliett ou Juliet ?",
        "answer": "Les formes officielles sont Alfa et Juliett ; le service accepte aussi Alpha et Juliet au décodage."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 638,
      "sort_order": 20,
      "published": true,
      "data": {
        "question": "Pourquoi les pilotes disent-ils Niner, Fife et Tree ?",
        "answer": "La variante aviation emploie ces formes pour éviter les confusions entre chiffres."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 639,
      "sort_order": 30,
      "published": true,
      "data": {
        "question": "Puis-je écouter la prononciation ?",
        "answer": "Oui. Le navigateur lit les mots codés avec sa synthèse vocale et la vitesse est réglable."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 640,
      "sort_order": 40,
      "published": true,
      "data": {
        "question": "Les alphabets NATO et ICAO sont-ils identiques ?",
        "answer": "Oui. La norme s’appelle International Radiotelephony Spelling Alphabet."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 641,
      "sort_order": 50,
      "published": true,
      "data": {
        "question": "Comment formater les mots codés ?",
        "answer": "Choisissez espaces, traits d’union, virgules ou retours à la ligne ; le format A = Alfa est aussi disponible."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 642,
      "sort_order": 60,
      "published": true,
      "data": {
        "question": "Que se passe-t-il avec les caractères non pris en charge ?",
        "answer": "L’encodeur les ignore ; un mot inconnu au décodage devient ?."
      }
    }
  ],
